<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Coles spikes property float option.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Coles spikes property float option.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's largest retailer, Coles Myer Ltd said on Monday it would no longer consider the floating of its property assets.</p>
<p>Coles said this followed agreements reached with various investors for the sale of a number of its major retail property assets for a total A$558 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
